{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define an operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17950ad2ab63c764778b133f95a03dcf2969d57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\star$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for positive real numbers as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff3c1f09b31819086f62acf5ea68a90e93f3ea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\star b=\\frac{ab}{a+b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"101\" height=\"39\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25ee6fe35a3ce297d5238e1f885f50961ed32114.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\star (4 \\star 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/0/c000bc37638a61938500f347e0c3ab4292fc34af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{3}{4}\\quad \\text{(B) } 1\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{4}{3}\\quad \\text{(D) } 2\\quad \\text{(E )} \\frac{16}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"283\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b0cf08dd6a736e72f7854601eda440c29e76855.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\star 4 \\star 4 = 4 \\star 2 = \\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"157\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>Solution by VivekA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a